EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}It's still cold outside, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Good thing it's also still so pretty
outside,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Es ist immer noch kalt, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Wenigstens ist der Schnee nett
anzusehen, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}You're always so peppy, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Must be all this snow keeping
you on your toes, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Menuda energía gastas, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Seguro que es la nieve lo que te
mantiene despiert{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sei sempre così vivace, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Secondo me è la neve che
ti mantiene frizzante, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Du wirkst so lebhaft, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Muss wohl dieser Schnee sein, der
dich auf Trab hält, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sen hep ne kadar enerjiksin, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Herhalde bu kar seni hep tetikte
tutuyor, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Hey again, hello{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Walking out in the snow, huh?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Well, good for you, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Ah, hola otra vez{{TAG:0007:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Disfrutando de la nieve, ¿eh?
Me alegro por ti, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Ehi, hola{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Eccoti di nuovo qua.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ti fai un giretto nella neve, eh?
Mi fa piacere, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hey, I heard your feet crunching
all the way here, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
What's up now, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Llevo oyendo un rato como la nieve
cruje bajo tus pies, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¿Qué te cuentas, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ehi, ho sentito il rumore dei tuoi
passi sulla neve, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Dimmi tutto, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hey, ich hab dich schon von Weitem 
durch den Schnee stapfen gehört.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Was gibt's diesmal, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hey, ayaklarının karı ezme sesini
buradan duydum, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Şimdi ne var, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Hey again, good to see you{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Think the snow will stop by
tomorrow, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Me alegro de verte otra vez{{TAG:0007:0007:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}! ¿Crees que dejará
de nevar mañana?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Ehi, che bello rivederti{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Pensi che smetterà di nevicare
prima di domani, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hey! {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Schön, dich wiederzusehen{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Glaubst du, es hört bis morgen auf
zu schneien, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Entonces, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}sigues en la nieve, ¿eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Ten cuidado no se te vaya a helar
el dedo gordo del pie, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.
